{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments [{:quotes [{:he "ארבעים שנה", :translit "arba'im shanah", :gloss "forty years"} {:he "ודעת עם לבבך", :translit "v'yadata im l'vav'kha", :gloss "and you shall know with your heart"} {:he "לבבך", :translit "l'vav'kha", :gloss "your heart"} {:he "מ\"ם", :translit "mem", :gloss "mem (numerical value 40)"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :gematria, :a "לבבך", :b "מ\"ם"}], :frame {:text "Forty is the age of understanding: Pirkei Avot 5:21 states 'a son of forty for understanding' (בן ארבעים לבינה). The midrashic reading of Exodus 7:7 places Moses at eighty when he stood before Pharaoh — forty years in Pharaoh's palace and forty years in Midian — so that only at forty did he reach full grasp of his master's teaching. The physical placement of the heart in the center of the body echoes the letter mem's position in the middle of the alef-bet.", :sources ["Pirkei Avot 5:21" "Exodus 7:7"]}}], :arithmetic [{:kind :gematria, :a "לבבך", :a-value 54, :b "מ\"ם", :b-value 80, :lens :standard, :by :selah, :equal? false}], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :discipline "bht-chalkboard-v1", :timestamp "2026-07-12T23:35:10.331570346Z", :model "glm-5.2"}